<p>A Russian wheat cargo ship sank in the Sea of Azov after what Russian-installed Kherson official Vladimir Saldo described as a Ukrainian drone attack on April 3, leaving one crew member dead and two missing. The vessel was identified as the Volgo-Balt, and Saldo said the crew abandoned ship as it began to go under before survivors reached shore near Strelkovoye in the Kherson region two days later. The claim about what caused the sinking comes from Russian and Russian-installed officials. The provided reports do not include a Ukrainian response or independent verification of the strike.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Vessel identity: RT, citing TASS and MarineTraffic, identified the ship as the Russian-flagged Volga-Balt-138.</li><li>Last signal: MarineTraffic data cited by RT showed the ship&#x27;s last signal was received three days before the reported incident.</li><li>Lifeboat escape: RT said nine crew members evacuated in a lifeboat capsule.</li><li>Casualty identified: RT identified the dead crew member as the senior assistant captain.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Vladimir Saldo: The Russian-installed Kherson official said Ukrainian drones hit the vessel and called the episode a terrorist attack, adding that there would be accountability. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/637386-ukraine-drone-attack-grain-vessel/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Meduza: Meduza took a cautious approach, saying Russian state media blamed the deadly sinking on a drone attack rather than presenting the claim as independently verified fact. (<a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/06/a-wheat-cargo-ship-sank-off-the-coast-of-kherson-and-russian-state-media-says-a-deadly-drone-attack-is-to-blame'>Meduza</a>)</li><li>South China Morning Post: SCMP highlighted the delay in reporting, saying the attack was said to have happened on Friday but the crew could not report what happened until Sunday. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/russia-central-asia/article/3349105/ukrainian-drones-attacked-cargo-ship-sank-killing-1-russian-official-says'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/637386-ukraine-drone-attack-grain-vessel/'>One dead after Ukrainian drone attacked grain vessel in Azov sea – official</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/russia-central-asia/article/3349105/ukrainian-drones-attacked-cargo-ship-sank-killing-1-russian-official-says'>Russian wheat freighter sinks after attack by Ukrainian drones</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/06/a-wheat-cargo-ship-sank-off-the-coast-of-kherson-and-russian-state-media-says-a-deadly-drone-attack-is-to-blame'>A wheat cargo ship sank off the coast of Kherson, and Russian state media says a deadly drone attack is to blame</a> - meduza.io</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/ukrainian-drones-attacked-cargo-vessel-that-sank-killing-one-russia-installed-official-says'>Ukrainian drones attacked cargo vessel that sank, killing one, says Russia-installed official</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>